---
description: Validate every client input on the server, including maximum size.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Input validation

The server must not trust anything from the client.

- Validate type, format, and an allowlist of fields before use.
- Reject unexpected properties.
- Give every text field a reasonable maximum length, and every upload a reasonable maximum size.
- Reject a payload that exceeds the limit instead of reading it all into memory.
- Choose the limit for the field's real use. Record the number in that side's build brief when you add the field.
- Do not accept client-supplied identity, ownership, object keys, MIME types, or store URLs as proof.
